WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.451 --> 00:00:03.341
Unit nineteen. Global Collaboration!

2
00:00:04.413 --> 00:00:10.575
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English, Level six!

3
00:00:10.625 --> 00:00:14.281
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.331 --> 00:00:18.462
Today we learn: Global Collaboration. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.879 --> 00:00:24.762
Global collaboration. Say it with me. Global collaboration!

6
00:00:28.301 --> 00:00:34.334
International cooperation. Say it with me. International cooperation!

7
00:00:37.777 --> 00:00:41.444
Shared goal. Say it with me. Shared goal!

8
00:00:44.976 --> 00:00:48.876
Diplomacy. Say it with me. Diplomacy!

9
00:00:52.344 --> 00:00:56.094
Partnership. Say it with me. Partnership!

10
00:00:59.593 --> 00:01:03.376
Cross-border. Say it with me. Cross-border!

11
00:01:06.912 --> 00:01:11.146
United effort. Say it with me. United effort!

12
00:01:14.628 --> 00:01:18.328
Progress. Say it with me. Progress!

13
00:01:21.854 --> 00:01:31.332
Grammar time! Nominalization. Listen. International cooperation leads to global progress.

14
00:01:31.382 --> 00:01:37.670
Your turn. Say it with me. International cooperation leads to global progress.

15
00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:56.178
Global collaboration relies on international cooperation toward a shared goal. Diplomacy and strong partnerships across borders make united efforts possible, driving real progress on global challenges.

16
00:01:56.228 --> 00:01:57.770
I like this story!

17
00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:04.225
Look! What's the word?

18
00:02:04.275 --> 00:02:05.425
Shared goal!

19
00:02:06.371 --> 00:02:11.746
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:11.796 --> 00:02:13.253
United effort!

21
00:02:14.412 --> 00:02:24.133
Think and answer. What global challenge do you think requires international cooperation?

22
00:02:24.183 --> 00:02:25.333
Great answer!

23
00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:29.748
This unit's value is Global Unity.

24
00:02:29.798 --> 00:02:32.731
I can show global unity every day!

25
00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:45.103
Congratulations, everyone! You finished Secondary Level six, the last level of C2-EPE Secondary English. I am so proud of you. Goodbye!

26
00:02:45.153 --> 00:02:48.310
Thank you, Teacher Vibol! We did it!

